<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 3.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 3.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the</p>
<p>following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for</p>
<p>Saturday, May 3:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,492.90 (1,450.00)	CHF  1,017.00 (993.29)</p>
<p>    DEM    866.15 (845.33)	  GBP  2,406.60 (2,354.20)</p>
<p>    ATS    123.09 (120.17)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $13.33 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 9.64 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $22.97 million ($33.89 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
